          <Link href="/planner" className="p-6 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 transition space-y-3 group">
            <div className="text-3xl">🗺️</div>
            <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition">2. Route & Tachograaf Optimalisatie</h3>
            <p className="text-xs text-slate-400">
              Combineer tankstops met verplichte 45-minuten tachograafpauzes en bereken de keiharde maximale actieradius inclusief veiligheidsmarge.
            </p>
          </Link>

          <Link href="/stations" className="p-6 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-800/80 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 transition space-y-3 group">
            <div className="text-3xl">⛽</div>
            <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition">3. Tankstations & Parkeren</h3>
            <p className="text-xs text-slate-400">
